{
  "title": "CARLS KEYPAD AND VOICE TEST",
  "id": "carls_keys_voice_test",
  "start_info": {"icon_src": "", "query": []},
  "objectives": [
    {
      "title": "CARLS KEYPAD AND VOICE TEST",
      "commands": [
        {"set":{"local":"t1_status"},"value":"PENDING"},
        {"set":{"local":"t2_status"},"value":"PENDING"},
        {"set":{"local":"t2_part"},"value":""},
        {"set":{"local":"t2_run"},"value":0},
        {"set":{"local":"t2_stop"},"value":0},
        {"set":{"global":"KT_COUNT"},"value":0},
        {"set":{"global":"KT_L1"},"value":""},
        {"set":{"global":"KT_L2"},"value":""},
        {"set":{"global":"KT_L3"},"value":""},
        {"set":{"global":"KT_L4"},"value":""},
        {"set":{"global":"KT_L5"},"value":""},
        {"set":{"global":"KT_L6"},"value":""},
        {"set":{"global":"KT_L7"},"value":""},
        {"set":{"global":"KT_L8"},"value":""},
        {"set_briefing_dialog":1},
        {"wait_for":1,"lt":0}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "macros": {
    "keytest log": [
      {"#comment":"Adds one line (param text) at the top of the briefing list and shows it as a message."},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L8"},"value":{"global":"KT_L7"}},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L7"},"value":{"global":"KT_L6"}},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L6"},"value":{"global":"KT_L5"}},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L5"},"value":{"global":"KT_L4"}},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L4"},"value":{"global":"KT_L3"}},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L3"},"value":{"global":"KT_L2"}},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L2"},"value":{"global":"KT_L1"}},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L1"},"value":{"param":"text"}},
      {"set_message":{"text":{"param":"text"}}}
    ],
    "keytest event": [
      {"#comment":"Logs one CARLS keypad event: dt = seconds since the previous event, n = events of this burst (same key, less than 1.5 s apart), t = seconds since the first event of the burst (about how long the key has been held)."},
      {"set":{"local":"keytest_now"},"value":{"var":["E:ABSOLUTE TIME","seconds"]}},
      {"set":{"local":"keytest_dt"},"value":{"subtract":[{"local":"keytest_now"},{"global":"KT_LAST"}]}},
      {"if": {"and":[{"require":{"local":"keytest_dt"},"lt":1.5},{"require":{"global":"KT_NAME"},"eq":{"param":"name"}}]}, "eq": 1,
        "then": [
          {"set":{"global":"KT_N"},"value":{"add":[{"global":"KT_N"},1]}}
        ],"else": [
          {"set":{"global":"KT_N"},"value":1},
          {"set":{"global":"KT_START"},"value":{"local":"keytest_now"}}
      ]},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_NAME"},"value":{"param":"name"}},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_LAST"},"value":{"local":"keytest_now"}},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_COUNT"},"value":{"add":[{"global":"KT_COUNT"},1]}},
      {"set":{"local":"keytest_text"},"value":{"text":"KEYTEST {0} n={1} dt={2} t={3}","params":[{"param":"name"},{"global":"KT_N"},{"tofixed":{"local":"keytest_dt"},"digits":2},{"tofixed":{"subtract":[{"local":"keytest_now"},{"global":"KT_START"}]},"digits":2}]}},
      {"call_macro":"keytest log","params":{"text":{"local":"keytest_text"}}}
    ],
    "keytest hold": [
      {"#comment":"For 60 s every CARLS key logs its events (newest first in the briefing), so a held key shows whether the keypad sends one event, repeated events or a release event (the base events and the guessed _UP _DOWN _RELEASE _RELEASED _HOLD _LONG _LONGPRESS _REPEAT variants for keys 5 and STAR). A watcher adds an END line 1.2 s after the last event of a burst with the time spanned by its events."},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_NAME"},"value":""},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_N"},"value":0},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_COUNT"},"value":0},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_START"},"value":0},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_REPORTED"},"value":-1},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_RUN"},"value":1},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_LAST"},"value":{"subtract":[{"var":["E:ABSOLUTE TIME","seconds"]},1000]}},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L1"},"value":""},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L2"},"value":""},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L3"},"value":""},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L4"},"value":""},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L5"},"value":""},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L6"},"value":""},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L7"},"value":""},
      {"set":{"global":"KT_L8"},"value":""},
      {"set":{"local":"t1_status"},"value":"RUNNING for 60 s: press and hold CARLS key 5 for 3 s, then key STAR"},
      {"set_message":{"text":"KEYPAD TEST ON: press and hold CARLS key 5 for 3 s, then key STAR. Read the list in the briefing."}},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_0","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"0"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_1","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"1"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_2","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"2"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_3","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"3"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_4","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"4"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_5","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"5"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_6","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"6"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_7","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"7"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_8","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"8"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_9","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"9"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_L1","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"L1"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_L2","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"L2"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_L3","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"L3"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_R1","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"R1"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_R2","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"R2"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_R3","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"R3"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_LEFT","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"LEFT"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_RIGHT","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"RIGHT"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_STAR","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"STAR"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_SHARP","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"SHARP"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_5_UP","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"5_UP"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_5_DOWN","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"5_DOWN"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_5_RELEASE","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"5_RELEASE"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_5_RELEASED","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"5_RELEASED"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_5_HOLD","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"5_HOLD"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_5_LONG","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"5_LONG"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_5_LONGPRESS","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"5_LONGPRESS"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_5_REPEAT","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"5_REPEAT"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_STAR_UP","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"STAR_UP"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_STAR_DOWN","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"STAR_DOWN"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_STAR_RELEASE","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"STAR_RELEASE"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_STAR_RELEASED","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"STAR_RELEASED"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_STAR_HOLD","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"STAR_HOLD"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_STAR_LONG","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"STAR_LONG"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_STAR_LONGPRESS","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"STAR_LONGPRESS"}}]},
      {"create_event_handler":"MISSION_RADIO_CARLS_STAR_REPEAT","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest event","params":{"name":"STAR_REPEAT"}}]},
      {"create_thread":{"commands":[
        {"while":{"global":"KT_RUN"},"eq":1,
          "do": [
            {"sleep":0.25},
            {"set":{"local":"kt_idle"},"value":{"subtract":[{"var":["E:ABSOLUTE TIME","seconds"]},{"global":"KT_LAST"}]}},
            {"if": {"and":[{"require":{"global":"KT_N"},"gt":0},{"require":{"local":"kt_idle"},"gt":1.2},{"require":{"global":"KT_REPORTED"},"ne":{"global":"KT_LAST"}}]}, "eq": 1,
              "then": [
                {"set":{"global":"KT_REPORTED"},"value":{"global":"KT_LAST"}},
                {"set":{"local":"kt_end"},"value":{"text":"END {0}: n={1} events over {2} s (key held about that long, up to 1 s more)","params":[{"global":"KT_NAME"},{"global":"KT_N"},{"tofixed":{"subtract":[{"global":"KT_LAST"},{"global":"KT_START"}]},"digits":2}]}},
                {"call_macro":"keytest log","params":{"text":{"local":"kt_end"}}}
            ]}
        ]}
      ]}},
      {"create_thread":{"commands":[
        {"sleep":60},
        {"set":{"global":"KT_RUN"},"value":0},
        {"set":{"local":"t1_status"},"value":{"text":"FINISHED: {0} events logged. END lines give the length of each press.","params":[{"global":"KT_COUNT"}]}},
        {"set_message":{"text":"KEYPAD TEST OFF"}},
        {"sleep":5},
        {"set_message":{"text":" "}}
      ]}}
    ],
    "voice dialog test": [
      {"if":{"local":"t2_run"},"eq":1,"then":[{"set_message":{"text":"VOICE TEST already running: press STOP VOICE and wait a few seconds."}}],"else":[{"call_macro":"voice dialog run"}]}
    ],
    "voice dialog run": [
      {"set":{"local":"t2_run"},"value":1},
      {"set":{"global":"TEST_VOL"},"value":40},
      {"set":{"local":"t2_stop"},"value":0},
      {"#comment":"Needs the HPG Mission Companion (or another voice server with the same protocol) running. Speaks a short conversation of the crew with the actor tags (actor 1 Pilota, 2 Copilota, 3 Doctor, 4 HEMS1, 5 HEMS2, 6 Frank, 7 Sarah, 8 Dispatcher, 9 Ground unit, 10 Patient), then a voice forced by name, forced speeds, the language tag, square brackets and an interrupt. If every line has the same voice the tags were removed on the way."},
      {"set":{"local":"t2_status"},"value":"RUNNING (about 2 minutes): listen"},
      {"connect_voice_server":{"on_connected":[{"set":{"local":"t2_connected"},"value":1}],"on_disconnected":[{"set":{"local":"t2_status"},"value":"FAILED: no voice server available. Start HPGMissionCompanion.exe first."},{"set_message":{"text":"VOICE TEST: no voice server available. Start HPGMissionCompanion.exe first."}}]}},
      {"sleep":1.5},
      {"create_thread":{"commands":[
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set_message":{"text":"VOICE TEST START: listen to the voices, they change with the actor."}}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor1>Voice test starting.","interrupt":1}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":3}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set_message":{"text":"VOICE TEST 1/7: crew conversation (actors 1 to 5)"}}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set":{"local":"t2_part"},"value":"VOICE TEST 1/7: crew conversation (actors 1 to 5)"}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor1>Crew, this is the pilot. Dispatch gives us a hiker with a leg injury, six miles north. The weather is good."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":10.1}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor2>Copilot copy. Fuel is full. I will take the radios and the navigation."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":6.7}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor3>Doctor here. I need the trauma bag and the splint ready for the hoist."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":7.1}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor4>HEMS one ready. I take the hoist and the stretcher."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":5.3}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor5>HEMS two ready. I stay on the winch and watch the cable."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":6.2}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor1>Good. Doors are closed. We lift off in one minute."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":5.3}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor2>Copilot to all. Checklist complete, the rotor is stable."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":4.9}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor3>Doctor. After landing I will assess the patient first."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":4.9}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set_message":{"text":"VOICE TEST 2/7: technicians, dispatcher, ground unit, patient (actors 6 to 10)"}}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set":{"local":"t2_part"},"value":"VOICE TEST 2/7: technicians, dispatcher, ground unit, patient (actors 6 to 10)"}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor6>Frank, technician. Aircraft checks are complete. You are clear to go."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":5.8}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor7>Sarah, technician. The rotor area is clear. Good luck."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":4.9}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor8>Dispatcher to HEMS. The patient is conscious and waiting near the trail."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":6.2}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor9>Ground unit on scene. We marked the landing area with a red tarp."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":6.7}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor10>Please hurry. My leg really hurts!"}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":3.6}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set_message":{"text":"VOICE TEST 3/7: voice forced by name and speed forced by the mission"}}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set":{"local":"t2_part"},"value":"VOICE TEST 3/7: voice forced by name and speed forced by the mission"}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<Microsoft David>This is the Windows voice David, forced by name."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":4.9}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<ryan>This is the Piper voice Ryan, forced by name. If it is not installed the actor voice speaks."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":8.8}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor3><speed:1.6>The doctor speaks fast, speed one point six."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":3.1}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor3><speed:0.7>The doctor speaks slowly, speed zero point seven."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":6}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor3>The doctor again, at the speed chosen in the Mission Companion."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":5.8}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set_message":{"text":"VOICE TEST 4/7: language tag and square brackets"}}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set":{"local":"t2_part"},"value":"VOICE TEST 4/7: language tag and square brackets"}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<IT><actor1>Ciao, questa e la voce italiana del pilota."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":4.5}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<IT><actor2>Ciao, io sono il copilota, parlo italiano."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":4}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<EN>[actor4]Square brackets, HEMS one speaking."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":3.2}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"[actor5][speed:1.3]Square brackets, HEMS two speaking faster."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":2.9}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set_message":{"text":"VOICE TEST 5/7: volume tag (100, 50, 20 and a value passed by the mission)"}}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set":{"local":"t2_part"},"value":"VOICE TEST 5/7: volume tag (100, 50, 20 and a value passed by the mission)"}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor1><vol:100>Volume one hundred."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":2.3}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor1><vol:50>Volume fifty."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":1.9}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor1><vol:20>Volume twenty, very quiet."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":2.7}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":{"text":"<actor1><vol:{0}>This volume comes from a mission variable, value {0}.","params":[{"global":"TEST_VOL"}]}}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":4.9}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set_message":{"text":"VOICE TEST 6/7: radio effect (beep, hiss, filter, squelch tail)"}}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set":{"local":"t2_part"},"value":"VOICE TEST 6/7: radio effect (beep, hiss, filter, squelch tail)"}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor1><radio>Pilot to dispatch, radio check."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":3.9000000000000004}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor8><radio>Dispatcher to pilot, loud and clear."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":4.3}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor2><vol:60><radio>Copilot, quieter radio call."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":3.4000000000000004}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor3><radio>This part is on the radio. <radio:off>This part is clean again."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":6.5}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor4>HEMS one, clean voice without the radio."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":4}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set_message":{"text":"VOICE TEST 7/7: interrupt. The long sentence must be cut off."}}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"set":{"local":"t2_part"},"value":"VOICE TEST 7/7: interrupt. The long sentence must be cut off."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor1>This is a long sentence that the next message has to cut off in the middle, so you should not hear the end of it at all."}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":3}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"speak":"<actor2>Interrupted. This sentence replaced the long one.","interrupt":1}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":0,"then":[{"sleep":5}]},
        {"if":{"local":"t2_stop"},"eq":1,"then":[{"set":{"local":"t2_status"},"value":"STOPPED"},{"set":{"local":"t2_part"},"value":""}],"else":[{"set_message":{"text":"VOICE TEST END. Report: different voices for the actors? tags removed? forced voice and speed? Italian lines? square brackets? interrupt?"}},{"set":{"local":"t2_part"},"value":""},{"if":{"fn":"is_voice_server_connected"},"eq":1,"then":[{"set":{"local":"t2_status"},"value":"FINISHED, voice server connected. Report what you heard."}],"else":[{"set":{"local":"t2_status"},"value":"FAILED: the voice server was not connected, nothing was spoken."}]}]},
        {"set":{"local":"t2_run"},"value":0},
        {"set":{"local":"t2_stop"},"value":0},
        {"sleep":8},
        {"set_message":{"text":" "}}
      ]}}
    ],
    "voice stop": [
      {"set":{"local":"t2_stop"},"value":1},
      {"speak":"<stop>","interrupt":1},
      {"set":{"local":"t2_status"},"value":"STOPPED"}
    ]
  },
  "briefing": [
    {"text":"CARLS KEYPAD AND VOICE TEST","size":"large","align":"center"},
    {"text":"Two independent tests. Sit in the helicopter with the CARLS on. The voice test needs HPGMissionCompanion.exe running."},
    {"text":"1. CARLS keypad: for 60 s every key press is logged below (newest first). Press and hold key 5 for 3 s, then key STAR. One line per press with no extra line while holding = a long press cannot be recognised. Lines repeating at a constant dt = auto-repeat. A line like 5_UP or 5_RELEASE = a release event exists. Each line shows dt (seconds since the previous event), n (events in the burst) and t (seconds since the first event of the burst); 1.2 s after the last event an END line gives the time spanned."},
    {"buttonbar":[{"title":"1 CARLS KEYPAD HOLD TEST (60 S)","commands":[{"call_macro":"keytest hold"}]},{"text":"{0}","params":[{"local":"t1_status"}],"color":"green"}]},
    {"text":"{0}","params":[{"global":"KT_L1"}],"color":"yellow"},
    {"text":"{0}","params":[{"global":"KT_L2"}],"color":"yellow"},
    {"text":"{0}","params":[{"global":"KT_L3"}],"color":"yellow"},
    {"text":"{0}","params":[{"global":"KT_L4"}],"color":"yellow"},
    {"text":"{0}","params":[{"global":"KT_L5"}],"color":"yellow"},
    {"text":"{0}","params":[{"global":"KT_L6"}],"color":"yellow"},
    {"text":"{0}","params":[{"global":"KT_L7"}],"color":"yellow"},
    {"text":"{0}","params":[{"global":"KT_L8"}],"color":"yellow"},
    {"text":"2. Voice: about two minutes of a crew conversation (Pilota, Copilota, Doctor, HEMS1, HEMS2, then Frank, Sarah, Dispatcher, Ground unit, Patient), a voice forced by name, forced speeds, Italian lines and square brackets, the volume tag, the radio effect, then an interrupt. Every actor must have the voice chosen in the Mission Companion. All lines with the same voice = the tags are removed on the way: read the [RAW] lines of the Mission Companion log."},
